@startuml
left to right direction
actor User
rectangle "Query Normalization" as Normalize
rectangle "Embedding Request" as EmbedReq
rectangle "Vector Search (Chroma)" as VSearch
rectangle "Scoring & Context Build" as Scoring
rectangle "Prompt Template" as Prompt
rectangle "LLM Invocation" as LLM
database "Vector DB\nchroma.sqlite3" as VDB
User --> Normalize
Normalize --> EmbedReq
EmbedReq --> VSearch : vector
VSearch --> Scoring : ids + scores
Scoring --> Prompt
Prompt --> LLM
LLM --> Scoring : answer
LLM --> Scoring : if unavailable -> fallback
VSearch --> VDB
@enduml
